(a) Write a Python program using NumPy to sort an array in ascending and descending order and display the indices of the sorted elements using np.argsort().

ANSWERS

import numpy as np

a = np.array([40, 10, 30, 20, 50])

i = np.argsort(a)
print("Ascending:", a[i])
print("Indices:", i)

j = np.argsort(a)[::-1]
print("Descending:", a[j])
print("Indices:", j)
