(b) Write a Python program using NumPy to accept 10 numbers from the user and create a NumPy array. Display all even numbers and odd numbers separately and find the second-largest and second-smallest elements .

ANSWERS

import numpy as np

a = np.array([int(input("Enter number: ")) for i in range(10)])

print("Even:", a[a % 2 == 0])
print("Odd:", a[a % 2 != 0])

b = np.sort(a)
print("Second smallest:", b[1])
print("Second largest:", b[-2])
