(C) Write a Python program using NumPy to apply different discounts to an array of product prices: 
•	10% discount for prices above ₹5000 
•	5% discount for prices between ₹2000 and ₹5000 
•	No discount below ₹2000.

ANSWERS

import numpy as np

p = np.array([1000, 3000, 6000, 5000])

d = np.where(p > 5000, p * 0.10,
    np.where(p >= 2000, p * 0.05, 0))

print("Original prices:", p)
print("Discount:", d)
print("Final prices:", p - d)
