 (a) Write a Python program using NumPy to analyze daily temperature data and find the number of days where the temperature was above the average temperature. 
 
ANSWERS

import numpy as np

t = np.array([30, 32, 28, 35, 31, 36, 29])

avg = np.mean(t)
print("Average:", avg)
print("Days above average:", np.sum(t > avg))
