(b)Write a Python program using NumPy to create an array of product prices and calculate the discounted price using a 10% discount for products costing more than ₹1000. 
 
ANSWERS

import numpy as np

p = np.array([500, 1200, 2000, 800, 1500])

d = np.where(p > 1000, p * 0.90, p)

