(c) Write a Python program using NumPy to use Boolean indexing to identify customers whose: 
•	age is between 20 and 40 
•	purchase amount is greater than ₹5000.

import numpy as np

age = np.array([18, 25, 35, 45, 30])
purchase = np.array([6000, 4000, 7000, 8000, 9000])

result = (age >= 20) & (age <= 40) & (purchase > 5000)

print("Eligible customers:", result)
print("Ages:", age[result])
print("Purchase amounts:", purchase[result])
